<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>국가별 화면 비교 목차</title>
<style>
:root { --bg: #f7f7f8; --surface: #fff; --text: #1b1c1f; --muted: #60636b; --line: #dcdee3; --accent: #2f5bd3;
        --green: #217a46; --amber: #a35a00; --red: #d93036; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --bg: #131417; --surface: #1c1d21; --text: #e8e9ec; --muted: #a0a4ad; --line: #34363d; --accent: #8aa8ff;
          --green: #5fd18b; --amber: #ffb547; --red: #ff6b6f; }
}
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 14px/1.55 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 60px; }
h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
.card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; }
.card h2 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
.card a { color: var(--accent); }
.ok { color: var(--green); } .warn { color: var(--amber); } .err { color: var(--red); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>국가별 Samsung.com 화면 비교</h1>
  <div class="muted">상품별 최신 실행 · 각 리포트는 차이점 카드, 가격·메뉴·주요 스펙 표, 전체 캡쳐 부록으로 구성됩니다.</div>
  <div class="grid">
  {% for it in items %}
    <div class="card">
      <h2>{% if it.has_report %}<a href="{{ it.report }}">{{ it.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ it.title }}{% endif %}</h2>
      <div class="muted">{{ it.captured_at }} · 실행 {{ it.run }}</div>
      <div>조합 {{ it.n }}개 · <span class="ok">ok {{ it.status["ok"] }}</span>{% if it.status["unavailable"] %} · <span class="warn">unavailable {{ it.status["unavailable"] }}</span>{% endif %}{% if it.status["mismatch"] %} · <span class="warn">mismatch {{ it.status["mismatch"] }}</span>{% endif %}{% if it.status["error"] %} · <span class="err">error {{ it.status["error"] }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{ it.contexts|join(" · ") }}</div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
